kimedia.org/wiki/User:Llez\" title=\"User:Llez\">H. Zell</a>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}}}]},{"pageid":92837641,"title":"File:Bubalus bubalis (water buffalo) bathing in a rust-colored pond and looking at viewer, head above water, Don Det, Laos.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/29/Bubalus_bubalis_%28water_buffalo%29_bathing_in_a_rust-colored_pond_and_looking_at_viewer%2C_head_above_water%2C_Don_Det%2C_Laos.jpg/960px-Bubalus_bubalis_%28water_buffalo%29_bathing_in_a_rust-colored_pond_and_looking_at_viewer%2C_head_above_water%2C_Don_Det%2C_Laos.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bubalus_bubalis_(water_buffalo)_bathing_in_a_rust-colored_pond_and_looking_at_viewer,_head_above_water,_Don_Det,_Laos.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Water_buffalo\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Water buffalo\"><i>Bubalus bubalis</i> (water buffalo)</a> bathing in a rust-colored pond, and looking at the viewer, head above water, in <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Don_Det\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Don Det\">Don Det</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Si_Phan_Don\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Si Phan Don\">Si Phan Don</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laos\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Laos\">Laos</a>. This species is often cooling itself in the water (or in the mud), when the weather is hot."},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2019-05-27 09:37:31"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Basile_Morin\" title=\"User:Basile Morin\">Basile Morin</a>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}}}]},{"pageid":191978198,"title":"File:Buchen-Schleimrübling (Oudemansiella mucida) Bruderwald-20251026-RM-161037.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Buchen-Schleimr%C3%BCbling_%28Oudema